    <!-- User Manual Sections -->
    <string name="manual_roulette_title">How does the 24-Hour Roulette Work?</string>
    <string name="manual_roulette_body">1. Automatic Geolocation: The app identifies your nearest airports, train stations, and ferry ports.\n2. Max Budget: Adjust the slider (e.g. €100) to keep costs under control.\n3. Getaway Duration: Filter 24h, 48h, or 72h getaways in One-Way or Round-Trip mode.\n4. Smart Spin: When tapping \'Spin Roulette\', the engine checks hundreds of imminent departures and presents a Winning Card with countdown and historical low rates.</string>

    <string name="manual_modes_title">Real Mode vs Demo Simulation</string>
    <string name="manual_modes_body">🟢 Real Mode: Searches flights, trains, and boats in real time. Connects to official engines (Google Flights, Skyscanner, Trainline, Hafas, Ferryhopper) or your free BYOK Amadeus and Kiwi keys.\n\n⚪ Demo Mode: Allows testing all roulette features and animations with simulated sample data without using APIs or network data.\n\nToggle anytime from the top bar chip or in Settings.</string>

    <string name="manual_favorites_title">Favorites and Saved Trips</string>
    <string name="manual_favorites_body">Found an incredible flight or train but want to book later? Tap the heart ❤️ icon on any card.\n\nYour getaways are saved locally in your phone\'s protected storage (accessible from the ⭐ button on the top bar). You can check them offline anytime and export them to your calendar.</string>

    <string name="manual_radar_title">Deal Alert Radar</string>
    <string name="manual_radar_body">Tap the bell 🔔 on the top bar to configure the price radar:\n\n1. Set your target price (e.g. €30 or €45).\n2. The radar continuously scans departures and marks any trip under your threshold with the \'🔔 Deal!\' badge.\n3. Use the \'Deals Only\' filter chip to hide higher-priced trips and view only genuine last-minute bargains.</string>

    <string name="manual_luggage_title">24-Hour Express Cabin Luggage</string>
    <string name="manual_luggage_body">To travel in under 24 hours with zero luggage fees on low-cost carriers (Ryanair, EasyJet, Vueling), never check in luggage:\n\n1. Travel with a small under-seat backpack (40x20x25 cm).\n2. Keep liquids in bottles under 100ml inside a clear zip bag.\n3. Open the interactive \'🎒 Express Luggage\' checklist from the top bar before leaving home.</string>

    <string name="manual_chain_title">Chaining Trips and QR Sharing</string>
    <string name="manual_chain_body">Want to continue the adventure? On \'One-Way\' trips, tap \'Chain trip\' to make your arrival city the new origin for another surprise getaway.\n\nAlso, tap \'Share QR\' or \'Invite\' to produce an instant QR code and link that friends can scan to join you on the same route.</string>

