    <string name="legal_terms_title">Price Disclaimer &amp; BYOK Architecture</string>
    <string name="legal_terms_p1">TravelRoulette24 is a real-time spontaneous travel inspiration engine. All fares, schedules, and availability shown originate from public APIs or user-connected providers (Amadeus, Kiwi, Navitia, AviationStack, OpenTripMap, or custom BYOK APIs).</string>
    <string name="legal_terms_p2">Fares are dynamic and subject to change upon completing official booking with airlines or transport operators. TravelRoulette24 does not process payments or operate as a travel agency; users book directly through official provider websites.</string>
    <string name="legal_terms_p3">BYOK API Key Usage: API credentials entered remain linked to your personal accounts. The built-in Quota Governor acts as a preventative safeguard to minimize requests within your free tiers.</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_title">Zero-Tracking Privacy Guarantee</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_p1">Your privacy is absolute. This application does NOT collect, track, sell, or transmit your personal data, location history, saved itineraries, or API credentials to any remote server.</string>
    <string name="legal_privacy_p2">Provider credentials are stored exclusively in your device\'s hardware-encrypted sandbox. Tapping \'Clear All Keys\' instantly and irreversibly purges all local secrets.</string>
    <string name="legal_oss_title">Open Source Libraries Used</string>
    <string name="legal_oss_intro">TravelRoulette24 gratefully acknowledges the open-source community for the following software components:</string>
